    },
    "Each entry is one decoded packet. Tap to see when it arrived and every decoded field — including the realtime frame's historical lag, which is why the embedded 5-min value is always ~17 min behind." : {
      "comment" : "A footer for the LibreLoopStreamDebugView.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elke regel is één gedecodeerd pakket. Tik erop om te zien wanneer het binnenkwam en alle gedecodeerde velden — inclusief de historische vertraging van het realtime-frame, de reden dat de ingebedde 5-minutenwaarde altijd ~17 min achterloopt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each series is plotted by lifeCount (minutes since sensor start). Realtime current and Clinical word[5] are identical by spec — clinical dots should land on the realtime line except across reconnect gaps." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Libre 3 glucose streams.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elke reeks is uitgezet tegen lifeCount (minuten sinds sensorstart). Realtime-actueel en Clinical word[5] zijn volgens de specificatie identiek — de klinische punten horen op de realtime-lijn te liggen, behalve rond onderbrekingen door opnieuw verbinden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable" : {
      "comment" : "Enable button",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inschakelen"
